Geodiversidade do Brasil — Cassio Roberto da Silva and contributors (@geo-brasil: 0, is #reference, #part-of @geo-sources) { r_2ZQN8TT3KZYS9MCFGZV5A1V682
Cassio Roberto da Silva, organizer/contributors as credited in the edition. Geodiversidade do Brasil: conhecer o passado, para entender o presente e prever o futuro. CPRM, Rio de Janeiro, 2008, 264 pages. Português brasileiro. [Official repository, citation, and free PDF](https://rigeo.sgb.gov.br/handle/doc/1210).

Read the complete book as an accessible Brazilian regional/application companion. Its chapters connect Earth history, materials, life, water, resources, coasts, soils, geoconservation, hazards, and the physical setting of productive activity. It is deliberately broad and accessible rather than a substitute for detailed quantitative/specialist treatments.

